Text: geneva prevention and treatment services for noncommunicable diseases ncds have been severely disrupted since the covid-19 pandemic began according to a who survey released today. the survey which was completed by 155 countries during a 3-week period in may confirmed that the impact is global but that low income countries are most affected. this situation is of significant concern because people living with ncds are at higher risk of severe covid-19-related illness and death. the resu. 
Answer:

