    "explanation": "While the text mentions 'severely disrupted' services, it attributes this to the pandemic ('since the covid-19 pandemic began') rather than blaming internal human vice, corruption, or incompetence within the institutions themselves. It describes external impact, not internal failure due to toxicity."
  },
